Honey Rock Landing.","creation_time":1790043041,"id":3441747722680832,"post_url":"https://facebook.com/groups/livingingrandjunctioncolorado/permalink/3441747722680832/","react_count":3,"source_record_created_at":{"user_local":"2026-09-21T20:10:41.000-06:00","user_timezone":"America/Denver","utc":"2026-09-22T02:10:41.000Z"}},{"comment_count":0,"content":"","creation_time":1790041026,"id":3441721562683448,"post_url":"https://facebook.com/groups/livingingrandjunctioncolorado/permalink/3441721562683448/","react_count":0,"source_record_created_at":{"user_local":"2026-09-21T19:37:06.000-06:00","user_timezone":"America/Denver","utc":"2026-09-22T01:37:06.000Z"}},{"comment_count":0,"content":"🌀“Some traditions are carefully planned over time. Others become traditions before anyone realizes what happened.”\n\n“Twenty-five years ago, nobody set out to create one of Paonia’s signature annual events. The idea was much simpler: make a CD featuring local musicians, throw a party to celebrate it, and give people a chance to hear the vast amount of music being created in the North Fork Valley at the time. A quarter-century later, the party is still on.”\n\n-Stu Carlson, High Country Shopper and Spotlight\n\nAnd we are honoring the origins of this beloved tradition in many ways on this 25th anniversary of the fest! 💿🌶️✨\n\n➡️ Most notably, don’t miss the Mountain Harvest All Stars featuring original musicians from the very first installment. These legends were amazing then and are even more impressive now! Catch them in Paonia Town Park on Sunday at 3:30pm. \n\n➡️ Be sure to also join us for the Friday Night Street Party on Grand Ave, just like the very first fest. This special evening highlights all the quirky, fun, and artistic elements of the North Fork Valley. Explore art openings, grab some local grub, and be prepared for surprises. \n\n🗞️ Read Stu’s full write-up in the MHF Official Guide produced by High Country Spotlight & Shopper for the full heartwarming history of the festival.","creation_time":1790027392,"id":3441564832699121,"post_url":"https://facebook.com/groups/livingingrandjunctioncolorado/permalink/3441564832699121/","react_count":0,"source_record_created_at":{"user_local":"2026-09-21T15:49:52.000-06:00","user_timezone":"America/Denver","utc":"2026-09-21T21:49:52.000Z"}},{"comment_count":0,"content":"Come find a class that is right for you and your family! Call to set up a free trial class this month only!","creation_time":1790015058,"id":3441427482712856,"post_url":"https://facebook.com/groups/livingingrandjunctioncolorado/permalink/3441427482712856/","react_count":2,"source_record_created_at":{"user_local":"2026-09-21T12:24:18.000-06:00","user_timezone":"America/Denver","utc":"2026-09-21T18:24:18.000Z"}},{"comment_count":0,"content":"HELLO GRAND JUNCTION!!!!\nI'm offering pickup service if you have left over yard sale items that need to be taken to the thrift store you got piles of trash needed taken to the dump needing a pick up or delivery we can do that as well we are reasonable price dad and son trying to start a business and help are community please message me if you need my service or text me at 970 778 1219 thank you in advance.","creation_time":1790013710,"id":3441410786047859,"post_url":"https://facebook.com/groups/livingingrandjunctioncolorado/permalink/3441410786047859/","react_count":3,"source_record_created_at":{"user_local":"2026-09-21T12:01:50.000-06:00","user_timezone":"America/Denver","utc":"2026-09-21T18:01:50.000Z"}},{"comment_count":0,"content":"Join the Boys of Summer at the Botanical Gardens October 2nd!","creation_time":1790011705,"id":3441384679383803,"post_url":"https://facebook.com/groups/livingingrandjunctioncolorado/permalink/3441384679383803/","react_count":0,"source_record_created_at":{"user_local":"2026-09-21T11:28:25.000-06:00","user_timezone":"America/Denver","utc":"2026-09-21T17:28:25.000Z"}},{"comment_count":0,"content":"This coming Saturday!!!","creation_time":1790009550,"id":344135918938